2026-09-08 02:25:31,666 - __main__ - DEBUG - url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICC_Men%27s_Test_Team_Rankings, cleaned text: ICC Men's Test Team Rankings
| Administrator | International Cricket Council | 
|---|---|
| Creation | 2003 (as ICC Test Championship) | 
| Number of teams | 12 | 
| Current top ranking | Australia (123 rating) | 
